                            "raw": "{\n    \"prompt\": \"As a Senior Python Developer familiar with vector databases, I need to understand RAG's architecture and implement a basic retrieval pipeline. This hands-on tutorial will guide me through the process. By the end, I should be able to describe the RAG workflow and write a functional Python script for a basic RAG system. The tone is professional and technical, speaking peer-to-peer. Assume I have knowledge of Python typing, async/await, and API usage.\"\n}"
